  "details": "So recently one of my scripts failed to serialize variables.\n\nIn \"OnPostSerialization\", SerializationResult.success contained \"false\".\n\nAfter hours of debugging, I found out that one script had a  UdonSynced null array, which caused the RequestSerialization of another script (attached to the same GameObject) to fail.\n\nIt would be great if SerializationResult contained additional informations, for instance an error code, or an actual error message, explaining why a serialization failed. This would make the debugging so much easier.",
